<title>JAPAN: Airport Facilities - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Airport Facilities - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.14		vs	   11.45</p>
<p> Operating	    2.16		vs	    2.08</p>
<p> Current	    931 million	 vs	  918 million</p>
<p> Net		  928 million	 vs	  538 million</p>
<p> EPS		   23.05 yen	  vs	   17.24 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     41 million	  vs	  31 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Airport Facilities Co Ltd manages and rents facilities at Haneda (Tokyo) and Itami (Osaka) airports.</p>
